msgid ""
"Non-conformities and observations raised during this audit. When the audit "
"is closed (status \"Completed\"), the PDF report is archived in the "
"Documents tab."
msgstr ""
"Non-conformités et observations relevées pendant cet audit. À la clôture de "
"l'audit (statut « Terminé »), le rapport PDF est archivé dans l'onglet "
"Documents."

