msgid ""
"Add the functions and their required competences with the expected level, "
"say who holds them, link the trainings that give each competence, declare "
"the certificates and diplomas, plan the proposed actions, then archive the "
"file as evidence before the audit."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez les fonctions et leurs compétences requises avec le niveau attendu, "
"indiquez qui les exerce, liez les formations qui donnent chaque compétence, "
"déclarez les certificats et diplômes, planifiez les actions proposées, puis "
"archivez le dossier comme preuve avant l'audit."

