"Import the export of your identity provider, choose the remote access "
"groups, then follow up the gaps: administrator or remote access without MFA, "
"SMS or call only, account excluded without justification. Nothing is changed "
"automatically. Record the result as an effectiveness test of the control to "
"keep the evidence."
msgstr ""
