"Microsoft Entra ID: Protection > Authentication methods > User registration "
"details, download (columns userPrincipalName, methodsRegistered, "
"isMfaRegistered, isAdmin)."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Entra ID : Protection > Méthodes d'authentification > Détails de "
"l'inscription des utilisateurs, télécharger (colonnes userPrincipalName, "
"methodsRegistered, isMfaRegistered, isAdmin)."

