msgid ""
"Shows which important assets send their logs to a log platform (Wazuh, "
"Graylog, Elastic or OpenSearch, Splunk, syslog), which send nothing or "
"nothing for several days, and whether each platform keeps the logs long "
"enough and synchronizes the clocks."
msgstr ""
"Montre quels actifs importants envoient leurs journaux à une plateforme "
"(Wazuh, Graylog, Elastic ou OpenSearch, Splunk, syslog), lesquels n'envoient "
"rien ou plus rien depuis plusieurs jours, et si chaque plateforme conserve "
"les journaux assez longtemps et synchronise les horloges."

