msgid "Remove: deleted from the directory, end date or departure passed"
msgstr "Retirer : supprimé de l'annuaire, date de fin ou départ passés"

msgid "Suggestion rules"
msgstr "Règles de suggestion"

msgid ""
"Each account shows a suggestion and its reason (departure, inactivity, "
"privileged profile...). It is only a proposal: you decide."
msgstr ""
"Chaque compte affiche une suggestion et sa raison (départ, inactivité, "
"profil à privilèges...). Ce n'est qu'une proposition : c'est vous qui "
"décidez."

msgid "Decision differs from the suggestion"
msgstr "Décision différente de la suggestion"

msgid "Suggestion and reason"
msgstr "Suggestion et raison"

