msgid ""
"Action proposed from the Active Directory security audit (rule %s): review "
"and adapt each field, set an owner and a due date, then click \"Add\". "
"Nothing is created before, and the rule is linked to this action once it is "
"saved."
msgstr ""
"Action proposée depuis l'audit de sécurité de l'Active Directory (règle "
